  "details": "To replicate this bug, open VRChat > open menu > click camera tab > click stream camera > enable spout stream > click \"mask\" > disable UI > then view spout stream in a program like OBS\n\nNow when your menu is open, you will see red camera lines and textboxes in the spout stream. When stream camera is NOT open, you will see textboxes in spout stream. \n\nThe intended result is not seeing either red camera lines or textboxes at any time when UI is disabled in stream camera > mask > UI.",
